###
### CHATBOT CONFIG ENDPOINTS
###

### GET chatbot config by company ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/companies/1/chatbot

### POST create chatbot config (AI mode)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/companies/1/chatbot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "ai",
  "ai_provider": "openai",
  "ai_context": "Eres un asistente virtual amable y profesional",
  "ai_credentials": "sk-xxx",
  "is_active": true
}

### POST create chatbot config (Flow mode)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/companies/2/chatbot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "flow",
  "flow_json": {
    "welcome": {
      "msg": "Hola, bienvenido a nuestro servicio"
    },
    "menu": {
      "msg": "¿En qué puedo ayudarte?"
    }
  },
  "is_active": true
}

### PUT update chatbot config
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/companies/1/chatbot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "ai",
  "ai_context": "Nuevo contexto para el asistente"
}

### PATCH update chatbot state (activate)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/companies/1/chatbot/state
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": true
}

### PATCH update chatbot state (deactivate)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/companies/1/chatbot/state
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

